           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"AmaresBasis[settings, {metabolites, split}] \
generates basis function needed for Amares fitting.\\nThe settings are \
defined as {nSamp, bw, field, nuc, te, f0} and the metabolites are a member \
of\\n\\\"PE\\\", \\\"PC\\\", \\\"Piin\\\", \\\"Piex\\\", \\\"GPE\\\", \\\"GPC\
\\\", \\\"PTDC\\\", \\\"PCr\\\", \\\"ATP\\\", \\\"NAD\\\" and \
\\\"UDPG\\\".\\nWhen \\\"ATP\\\" is defined in split the 3 ATP peaks will be \
separate spectra to fit. \\nThe output is {basisFunc, {time, ppm, gyro}} \
where basisFunc is an Association.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
