parameter is shared between metabolites:\n-1 (unique): the metabolite has its \
own free parameter.\n0 (same): all metabolites with 0 share one common \
parameter.\n1, 2, ... (group-01, group-02, ...): all metabolites with the \
same number share one parameter, different numbers are different parameters.\n\
