  InformationData[<|
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "AnisoFilterTensor[tens, data] Filter the tensor tens using an \
anisotropic diffusion filter (Perona-Malik). \nIt uses the diffusion weighted \
data data to find edges that are not visible in the tensor.\nEdge weights \
based on the diffusion data are averaged over all normalized diffusion \
direction.\n\nAnisoFilterTensor[tens] Same but does not use the data for edge \
identification.\n\nOutput is the smoothed tensor.\n\nAnisoFilterTensor[] is \
based on DOI: 10.1109/ISBI.2006.1624856.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|
