   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "RegisterData[data] registers the data series. If data is 3D it performs \
multiple 2D registration, if data is 4D it performs multiple 3D registration.\
\nThe input data can be in the forms: data, {data, vox}, {data, mask} or \
{data, mask, vox}.\n\nRegisterData[target, moving] registers the moving data \
to the target data. target can be 2D or 3D. moving can be the same of one \
dimension higher than the target.\nThe inputs target and moving can be in the \
forms: data, {data, vox}, {data, mask} or {data, mask, vox}.\n\nOutput is the \
registered data with the dimensions of the moving data. \nIf \
OutputTransformation is True it also outputs the translation, rotation scale \
and skew of all images or volumes.\n\nRegisterData[] is based on DOI: \
10.1109/TMI.2009.2035616 and 10.3389/fninf.2013.00050.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/RegisterData"|>, 
