using the given voxel size only using data within the mask.\n\
RegisterDiffusionData[{dtiData ,vox}, {anatData, voxAnat}] registers a \
diffusion dataset. The diffusion data is also registered to the anatData.\n\
RegisterDiffusionData[{dtiData, dtiMask, vox}, {anatData, voxAnat}] registers \
the data series using the given voxel size only using data within the mask.\n\
RegisterDiffusionData[{dtiData,vox}, {anatData, anatMast, voxAnat}] registers \
the data series using the given voxel size only using data within the mask.\n\
RegisterDiffusionData[{dtiData, dtiMask, vox}, {anatData, anatMast, voxAnat}] \
registers the data series using the given voxel size only using data within \
the mask.\n\nOutput is the registered dtiData and, if anatData is given, the \
registered dtiData in anatomical space. If OutputTransformation is True it \
also outputs the translation, rotation scale and skew of all images or \
