lab] the same but the output is an association with the name lab, or one name \
per mask for a 4D mask.\\nAnalyzeActivations[actMap, mask, vox] the same but \
with the voxel size vox = {z, y, x} in mm, which adds the columns \\\"ROI Vol \
[dm3]\\\", \\\"Chance [%/dm3]\\\", \\\"Chance Obs [%/dm3]\\\" and the sizes \
as area in cm^2 \\\"Mean Area [cm2]\\\", \\\"StDv Area [cm2]\\\", \\\"Median \
Area [cm2]\\\", \\\"5% Area [cm2]\\\" and \\\"95% Area \
[cm2]\\\".\\nAnalyzeActivations[actMap, mask, lab, vox] the same with the \
name lab and the voxel size vox.\\n\\n\\\"Amount\\\" is the number of \
activations and \\\"Amount Obs\\\" the number of observations (a slice in one \
volume) that contain at least one activation.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
