  InformationData[<|
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "AddLossLayer[net] adds all loss layers to a NetGraph. The DiceLossLayer, \
JaccardLossLayer, TverskyLossLayer, MSDLossLayer, TopK, and CELossLayer are \
added.\nAddLossLayer[net, loss] only adds the loss layers given in loss, loss \
can be a string or a list of strings chosen from {\"Dice\", \"Jaccard\", \
\"Tversky\", \"MSD\", \"MAE\", \"MSDM\", \"MAEM\", \"CE\", \"Focal\", \
\"TopK\"}.\n\"MSDM\" and \"MAEM\" are the masked versions of \"MSD\" and \
\"MAE\": the loss is only computed over the part of the target that is \
nonzero.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/AddLossLayer"|>, 
