         {
          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"DiceSimilarity[ref, pred] gives the Dice Similarity \
between 1 and 0 of segmentations ref and pred for class equals \
1.\\nDiceSimilarity[x, y, class] gives the Dice Similarity of segmentations \
ref and pred for class.\\nDiceSimilarity[x, y, {class, ..}] gives the Dice \
