\"LowerLegs\", \"Hip\", \"Shoulder\", or \"Arm\".\nSegmentData[{data, vox}] \
and SegmentData[{data, vox}, what] additionally give the voxel size of data. \
Unless vox is {1, 1, 1}, data is rescaled before \nsegmentation to {vox[[1]], \
1.5, 1.5} for SegmentationDimension -> \"2D\" or to {6, 1.5, 1.5} for \"3D\".\
