vox] does the same for a list of classes.\nThe Method option controls the \
distance metric: \"Mean\", \"Median\", \"RMS\", \"HD\", \"HD95\" (default), \
or \"Std\". A list of \nmethods can be given to return multiple metrics at \
once.", "Documentation" -> <|
