   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "Tensor[{l1, l2, l3}] creates a diffusion tensor with vectors \
{{0,0,1},{0,1,0},{1,0,0}} and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \
{e1, e2, e3}] creates a diffusion tensor with vectors {e1, e2, e3} and \
eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \"Random\"] creates a \
diffusion tensor with random orthogonal eigenvectors {e1, e2, e2} and \
eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \"RandomZ\"] creates a \
diffusion tensor with random orthogonal eigenvectors {{1,0,0}, e2, e3} with \
random eigenvectors and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \
\"OrtRandom\"] creates a diffusion tensor with random orthogonal eigenvectors \
{{1,0,0},{0,1,0},{0,0,1}} and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[] is based on \
DOI: 10.1002/nbm.2959.", 
