tag grid are estimated from the power spectrum of the first frames. Per slice \
the displacement between consecutive frames is estimated\\nfrom the phase of \
the band pass filtered tag images for each tag direction and accumulated over \
the frames.\\n\\nOutput is {{ux, uy}, {im0, im, w0, w}}, all {slices, frames, \
y, x}, where ux and uy are the accumulated displacements in pixels along the \
first and second image dimension,\\nim0 are the reference images, im the \
