dataset.\\nResidualCalc[dti,{tensor,s0},outlier,gradients,bvector] calculates \
the tensor residuals for the given dataset taking in account the \
outliers.\\nResidualCalc[dti,{tensor,s0},bmat] calculates the tensor \
residuals for the given dataset.\\nResidualCalc[dti,{tensor,s0},outlier,bmat] \
calculates the tensor residuals for the given dataset taking in account the \
outliers.\\nResidualCalc[dti,tensor,gradients,bvector] calculates the tensor \
residuals for the given dataset. Tensor must contain \
Log[s0].\\nResidualCalc[dti,tensor,outlier,gradients,bvector] calculates the \
tensor residuals for the given dataset taking in account the outliers. Tensor \
must contain Log[s0].\\nResidualCalc[dti,tensor,bmat] calculates the tensor \
residuals for the given dataset. Tensor must contain \
