dataset. allows for multiple unweighted images and multiple bvalues.\\nbmat \
is the bmatrix which can be generated using Bmatrix.\\n\\nThe bvalue assumed \
to be is in s/mm^2 and therefore the output is in mm^2/2.\\n\\nTensorCalc[] \
