longest tracts.\\nFindTensorPermutation[tensor, vox, {par, {min, max}}] same \
but with additional stopping criteria par, where tracts are only generated \
between values of par min and max.\\nFindTensorPermutation[tensor, vox, \
{{par, {min, max}}, ..}] same but with multiple additional stopping criteria.\
\\n\\nOutput = {permutations, flips, plot}\\n\\nFindTensorPermutation[] is \
based on DOI: 10.1016/j.media.2014.05.012.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
